n't worry it's not over  yet and it only gets better we'll give  you a hint  the next Lego construction is an  important historical event that happened  back in 2009 and almost everyone in the  world was watching it what could it be  Obama's inauguration have you guessed it  if you're looking for a highly detailed  Lego creation you've found it it's  Obama's complete inauguration and it's  very impressive this masterpiece can be  found in Legoland in California and we  think they did a really good job check  it out from the parking lot to the crowd  this piece has some of the most amazing  detail we have ever seen it's made from  hundreds of thousands of bricks and we  can't even imagine how long it lasted  for the creators to build it how many  characters can you recognize in the  audience the designers made sure they  did an amazing job with the figurines  and the characters are definitely  recognizable the Vice president-elect o  Biden Michelle Obama Obama's daughters  George W Bush Barbara Bush and more if  you look closer you can even find Oprah  Winfrey in the crowd the figurines are  all faceless which makes the fact that  they're recognized  that much more amazing very impressive  but here's the sad part this creation  was only available for a limited amount  of time back in 2009 but that doesn't  mean there are other masterpieces worthy  of your visit really has no limits all  you need is imagination and a lot of  patience legoland  without a doubt one of the most amazing  LEGO creations that ever existed is the  Legoland a whole theme park built of  Legos with more Lego sculptures inside  yes please it sounds like a dream and  it's actually a reality you can find six  Lego lands out there and they're based  all around the world along with having  Lego rides you can also find amazing  structures like you've never seen before  the Legoland itself consists of more  than 65 million bricks it took eight  hundred and thirty thousand bricks to  build just the exact replicas of some of  the world's tallest buildings which  include Burj Khalifa Shanghai Tower  Makkah  oil clock tower Hotel One World Trade  Center and Taipei 101 very impressive  along with fascinating mega structures  you can also find interactive 3d rides  and 118 feet tall viewpoints that allow  you to see the entire theme park pretty  cool right so what else can you expect  when you visit like a LAN well there are  water parks aquariums and even hotels  and although the hotels aren't made from  Lego bricks on the outside the building  is a replica of a Lego brick made hotel  on the inside you can find themed rooms  and choose from pirate adventure Kingdom  and Lego friend themes what's the best  LEGO creation you've ever made let us  know in the comments below don't forget  to subscribe to our channel and hit the  like button if you love Legos for more  entertaining videos check out the  amazing evolution of iconic children's  toys thanks for watching  [Music]

